    "description": {
      "color": "#FF2A2A",
      "translate": "The first is to take some very spicy laps at the pool",
      "extra": [
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The second is to do something 5 more times and look like a fool"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The third is for a day, jump once for each and every last step"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The fourth is for a now-lost enigmatic step, do the prep"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The fifth is to show the blind that you can't be blinded more"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The sixth is to make a hand-me-hand-me-down of all the epic BACAP lore"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The seventh is to bridge the space over a gigantic abyss"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The eighth is to throw your projection at the ground... and miss"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The ninth is to use your automatic to swap back to a manual user"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "#FF2A2A",
          "translate": "The tenth, if you can achieve it, you will be the L.O.S.E.R.nnSuggested by BlackBird_6"
        }
      ]
    },
